§ 4.10(d)(3)
; or
(
iv
)
Continuously offered. If the pool is not continuously offered, the closing date of the offering must be disclosed.
(
4
)
The date when the commodity pool operator first intends to use the Disclosure Document; and
(
5
)
The break-even point per unit of initial investment, as specified in
§ 4.10(j)
.
(
e
)
Persons to be identified.
The names of the following persons:
(
1
)
Each principal of the pool operator;
(
2
